# Telco Customer Churn Prediction

A machine learning project to predict customer churn for a telecommunications company using Python and Scikit-Learn.

## Project Overview
This project analyzes customer data to identify patterns and predict whether a customer is likely to leave the service (churn). It helps businesses understand key risk factors and retain valuable customers.

## Project Structure
- `telco_churn_prediction.ipynb`: Jupyter notebook containing data preprocessing, exploratory data analysis (EDA), feature engineering, and model training.
- `churn_model.pkl`: Saved machine learning model file.

## Technologies Used
- Python
- Pandas, NumPy, Scikit-Learn
- Jupyter Notebook / Google Colab
